complete only when its implementation and stated verification evidence exist;
a page shell or mock alone is not sufficient for an API-backed feature. Legacy
completion means security-compatible functional parity for user and
administrator workflows. It does not reintroduce raw process, arbitrary Python,
or unrestricted system-command execution that would turn stored configuration
or a browser connection into server code execution.

